# The wide frame (MBUI_WIN=1280x800, 大屏): words sent, then three lines sent.
timeout 20000
until 发消息
wait 600
tap 发消息
wait 500
type 发布前再看一眼签名
wait 700
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 1800
tap 发消息
wait 500
type 先看一下签名
key shift+enter
type 再看发布说明
key shift+enter
type 最后核对版本号
wait 700
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 2200
exit
